    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, oghā. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, there are these four floods. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Katame cattāro? ",
      "english": "What four? "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Kāmogho, bhavogho, diṭṭhogho, avijjogho”ti. ",
      "english": "The floods of sensuality, desire to be reborn, views, and ignorance.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "vitthāretabbaṁ. ",
      "english": "(Tell in full as in SN 45.171–179.) "
